{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "SparkSyncAction, one write-back queued because the owner did not answer within the save (warehouse §4.2.5, owner",
    "decisions 2026-10-20), and the durable per-user record of how it ended. Shipped by MintPlayer.Spark.Replication;",
    "written only by the library, so every attribute is read-only. Each row is its initiator's alone (the Actions",
    "class's row rule); MyPendingChanges lists the caller's waiting and failed changes until dismissed. Changes, OpId",
    "and the timing fields are not attributes.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'replication:SparkSyncAction[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
